## Third-Party Content

This software includes functionality to download and process texts from
Archive.org (https://archive.org). All texts processed by this software
are in the public domain.

Specifically:
- All works by Friedrich Nietzsche (1844-1900) are in the public domain
- Archive.org provides public domain texts under no copyright restrictions
- No proprietary or copyrighted content is included in this repository

